GStreamer (codec-gst crate, H.264 codec)
----------------------------------------
- The gstreamer-rs Rust bindings are licensed MIT/Apache-2.0.
- The GStreamer runtime libraries are licensed LGPL-2.1-or-later.
- The avdec_h264 decoder (libav/gst-libav) is LGPL, like the rest of the
  runtime; it is loaded dynamically from the system and is not bundled.
- The x264enc element (gst-plugins-ugly, libx264) is licensed GPL.
- MightyMonitor loads these libraries dynamically from the system at run
  time and never bundles or redistributes them.
- Bundling GStreamer or any plugin with a release needs a separate license
  review first.
- A future Windows or Android backend should avoid GPL components.

